<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Toshiba Ceramics rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Toshiba Ceramics rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research Ltd has assigned Toshiba Ceramics Co Ltd a &quot;C&quot; rating, Daiwa Securities brokers said on Monday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;C&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects to underperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
